  "articleBody": "1) Core idea\n- punish only at rush end states\n- reset aggressively when spacing breaks\n\n2) Steps\n1) dodge the rush into its end state\n2) punish once\n3) reposition\n\nRelated: also read the dedicated Bodvar+Starolfr 2-boss page.",
